owhere near as powerful as Jean.","nextNodeIds":[200440105]},{"nodeId":200440105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":3401206545,"text":"I think it's better for me to focus on technique rather than power.","nextNodeIds":[200440106]},{"nodeId":200440106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":3066336449,"text":"For example, I was thinking about how to break all these wooden dummies in one fell swoop.","nextNodeIds":[200440107]},{"nodeId":200440107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":4079267401,"text":"If you're at a loose end, fancy helping me think about how to tackle it?","nextNodeIds":[200440108,200440109]},{"nodeId":200440108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3809097337,"text":"I'll mull it over.","nextNodeIds":[200440110]},{"nodeId":200440110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":4264831033,"text":"Sure, take your time. It's not like these dummies are going anywhere.","nextNodeIds":[200440111]},{"nodeId":200440111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":2495443353,"text":"Nor is my life going anywhere while I'm stuck trying to sort this out, ugh...","nextNodeIds":[200440114]},{"nodeId":200440114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":2193047401,"text":"If only I had a bigger weapon, or some powerful elemental ability like Jean, breaking all these wooden dummies would probably be a piece of cake.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":200440109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":911316041,"text":"How about we give it a go together...","nextNodeIds":[200440112]},{"nodeId":200440112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":1963916745,"text":"You like team combat, then? Alright for some... always someone to help you out.","nextNodeIds":[200440113]},{"nodeId":200440113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":3232288809,"text":"For people like me, the best I can do is try and hold my own as a lone fighter.","nextNodeIds":[200440114]}]},{"talkId":2004402,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","beginCond":[{"param":["2004401","3",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["2004402","2",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_AND","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_LOCAL","id":2004402,"initDialog":200440201,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[1605],"performCfg":"","priority":6,"questId":20044,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":200440201,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":2629357433,"text":"How are you getting along? Had a eureka moment yet?","nextNodeIds":[200440202]},{"nodeId":200440202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":651494625,"text":"Still thinking it over...","nextNodeIds":[200440203]},{"nodeId":200440203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1605,"speakerName":"Ellin","textMapHash":3506807529,"text":"Huh. I've met a few other adventurers b